OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1785161914
OL,3,CPolice officer killed during high-
OL,4,Cspeed chase receives royal recognition
OL,6,FA Hampshire Police officer who was
OL,7,Fkilled during a high-speed chase in
OL,8,Fthe 1980s has received royal
OL,9,Frecognition.
OL,11,FPC Kenneth Adams served as an officer
OL,12,Ffor 20 years after joining as a police
OL,13,Fcadet.
OL,15,FHe was based in Portsmouth and was
OL,16,Fpart of the traffic unit.
OL,18,FHe died in 1982 when his police car
OL,19,Fcrashed during a high-speed chase of a
OL,20,Fsuspect vehicle, in thick fog, near
OL,21,FBishops Waltham.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/6
