PN,38502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1785161914
OL,3,CPolice officer killed during high-
OL,4,Cspeed chase receives royal recognition
OL,6,FThe 38-year-old died alongside his
OL,7,Fcolleague, PC Paul Salmon, who was 28.
OL,9,FHis daughter, Alison Alvey, was just
OL,10,F13 years old when her father died.
OL,12,FShe decided to nominate him for the
OL,13,FElizabeth Emblem and accepted it on
OL,14,Fhis behalf.
OL,16,FThe national honour is awarded to
OL,17,Fthose who have died in public service
OL,18,Fto recognise the ultimate sacrifice
OL,19,Fthey made while dedicating their lives
OL,20,Fto helping their communities.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1785161914
OL,3,CPolice officer killed during high-
OL,4,Cspeed chase receives royal recognition
OL,6,FAlison said: "I thought that it would
OL,7,Fbe a fitting tribute to my dad.
OL,8,FFortunately, I had a large amount of
OL,9,Fnewspaper cuttings about my dad, as
OL,10,Fhis cousin had been keeping them
OL,11,Fwhenever he appeared in the
OL,12,Fnewspapers."
OL,14,FAmong the cuttings is one reporting on
OL,15,Fhis Royal Humane Society award for
OL,16,Fbravery, received only a year before
OL,17,Fhis death.
OL,26,@nD@NOUtD@LO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/6
