PN,38504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1785161914
OL,3,CPolice officer killed during high-
OL,4,Cspeed chase receives royal recognition
OL,6,FShe added: "We were on a family
OL,7,Fholiday in Malta when my dad spotted a
OL,8,Fcommotion on the beach. Without
OL,9,Fhesitation, he plunged into the rough
OL,10,Fsea and swam out to an 80-year-old
OL,11,Fwoman in distress, bringing her safely
OL,12,Fback to shore. He then helped revive
OL,13,Fher son-in-law, who had got into
OL,14,Ftrouble while trying to rescue her
OL,15,Fhimself.
OL,17,F"This was typical of my dad; always
OL,18,Fputting others before himself."
OL,26,@nD@LOUyD@AOUzD@_O]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/6
