OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1785161914
OL,3,CPolice officer killed during high-
OL,4,Cspeed chase receives royal recognition
OL,6,FPC Adams was a keen cricketer and
OL,7,Fplayed for the force team. While in
OL,8,Fthe force, he also gained his silver
OL,9,Fand gold Duke of Edinburgh awards.
OL,11,FChief Constable Alexis Boon said: "It
OL,12,Fwas an honour to see Alison accept
OL,13,Fthis remarkable award on behalf of her
OL,14,Ffather.
OL,16,F"PC Adams was undoubtedly an
OL,17,Fexceptional police officer who
OL,18,Fdemonstrated extraordinary courage
OL,19,Fthroughout his life and service, both
OL,20,Fon and off duty.
OL,26,@sD@cOUxD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/6
