OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1785161914
OL,3,CPolice officer killed during high-
OL,4,Cspeed chase receives royal recognition
OL,6,F"To have his sacrifice recognised in
OL,7,Fthis way is a fitting tribute to him
OL,8,Fand his family, who have lived with
OL,9,Fhis sudden and devastating loss.
OL,11,F"It is also a reminder to us all that
OL,12,Four police officers go to work every
OL,13,Fday, never knowing what they will be
OL,14,Fconfronted with. Despite the risks to
OL,15,Fthem, officers work selflessly to keep
OL,16,Fthe public safe and do what is needed
OL,17,Fto protect their communities."
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUyD@^O]
